 "ai": "normal",
 "intro": [
  "North of the fens the lantern-priests have built a temple-fortress whose lamps burn the dead at a hundred paces. Abbess Maud Lorne keeps it, and every night the court loses whole columns to its light. Corvin served in a temple like it, once. He knows where the oil is kept.",
  "Tier 5 is open: corpse weavers, who knit your fallen back together. While any of the three outer lanterns burns, the fortress sends its light out against your camp.",
  "Put out the three lanterns. Take the fortress."
 ],
 "outro": [
  {
   "text": [
    "The last lamp goes dark. In the temple vault Orrin finds a hundred years of records, among them the order that sealed the Wound: five peoples, one stone, and the roots of the Elderwold to hold it.",
    "He reads it twice, and then he says nothing at all for three days."
   ]
  }
